# --permission-mode dontAsk: never entered by cycling, and Shift+Tab leaves
# it for manual, as Claude Code's cycle returns to "default"
# (settings.NextPermissionMode). The design (Terminal.dc.html:222) only
# names three modes and has no "don't ask" entry; kiln's modeLabel
# (internal/tui/status.go) adds it for this CLI-only mode.
@faux testdata/faux/hello.yaml
@size 120x40
@args --permission-mode dontAsk

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT idle
EXPECT /don't ask/
KEY shift+tab
SHOT after-shift-tab
# dontAsk -> manual
EXPECT /ask before edits/
EXPECT_NOT /don't ask/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
